---
# Basic Clang-Tidy Configuration for Barrier
Checks: >
  -*,
  clang-diagnostic-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  readability-*,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -readability-braces-around-statements,
  modernize-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -modernize-use-nodiscard,
  -modernize-pass-by-value
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: ''
FormatStyle: none
...
